  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2052c910b9059494a91059036e4f34c8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ObjectivePopup
  panel: {fileID: 38469969}
  bodyText: {fileID: 2144286599}
  startDelay: 1.5
  fadeTime: 0.6
  autoHideAfter: 20
  message: 'You made it to the East Wing.


    Find and collect all 3 files, then
    go to Dr Gustavo to get your grandmother''s medication. Check the inventory to
    keep track of your progress.


    Be quick. The police will raid the hospital
    soon, and you can''t be caught here.


    Watch out for the ghost that haunts
    these halls and wards. Enter a room to be safe from the ghost. Use your torch
    and magnifying glass to help you.


    SAVE YOUR PROGRESS!


    <size=70%>Press
    Enter or Space to close</size>'
